[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3780442518","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115213#issuecomment-3780442518","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115213","id":3780442518,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hVPmW","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T18:31:57Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T18:39:43Z","body":"I don't think HashSets guarantee order, it says to use RBSet instead if \"Iteration order does matter\", so we can't rely on it to get the last changed setting.\r\n\r\nAlso multiple settings can be set at the same time, at least for EditorSettings, so checking just the last one should not be relied on.\r\nFor example `_set` changes `exec_flags` if `exec_path` is changed, and all the presets do similar.\r\nSince the notification is sent delayed, any settings can be changed at the same time by the user as well. So this could only be used in the signal callback for some settings, depending on if your callback gets handled before the other signal callbacks that may modify other settings and change the last set setting.\r\n\r\nAnd in ProjectSettings the `settings_changed` signal is deferred, so I don't know where `get_last_changed_setting()` could be relied on.\r\n\r\nThis is never used in the codebase, so does it really need to be exposed? And are there any other places this would be used?\r\nThe example in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115197 is a special case for presets and will be replaced by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114005 since that code shouldn't even be in EditorSettingsDialog.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3780442518/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3780587558","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115213#issuecomment-3780587558","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115213","id":3780587558,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hVzAm","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https: